      "source": [
        "# Automated Public Comparables (Comps) Valuation Matrix\n",
        "\n",
        "**Indian Listed Companies | Google Colab**\n",
        "\n",
        "Workflow: enter a target company → identify sector/industry → discover same-industry peers → pull market and financial data → calculate valuation multiples → value the target → generate a football field → export Excel.\n"
      ],
      "id": "egfD7SYvaLqa"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Q9g5D8FqaLqc"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. Install required libraries"
      ],
      "id": "Q9g5D8FqaLqc"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 130,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "DrblaZFPaLqc"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "!pip -q install yfinance beautifulsoup4 lxml requests pandas numpy matplotlib openpyxl"
      ],
      "id": "DrblaZFPaLqc"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2zg3r0wxaLqd"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 2. Import libraries"
      ],
      "id": "2zg3r0wxaLqd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "mnblCFC7aLqe"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import yfinance as yf\n",
        "import requests\n",
        "from bs4 import BeautifulSoup\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import time\n",
        "import warnings\n",
        "\n",
        "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n",
        "\n",
        "pd.set_option(\"display.max_columns\", 100)\n",
        "pd.set_option(\"display.width\", 180)\n",
        "pd.set_option(\"display.float_format\", lambda x: f\"{x:,.2f}\")"
      ],
      "id": "mnblCFC7aLqe"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "fuepT5_naLqf"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 3. Project settings and target-company input\n",
        "\n",
        "You only enter the target company. You do not enter the sector or peer group."
      ],
      "id": "fuepT5_naLqf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 131,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "bXuk4wmOaLqf",
        "outputId": "4961a494-832a-4bf5-cf41-6945e8029fa6"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Enter target company name or NSE ticker (e.g., TCS, Infosys, Reliance): OBEROIRLTY\n",
            "\n",
            "Target entered: OBEROIRLTY\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "MAX_PEERS = 8\n",
        "MIN_PEERS = 4\n",
        "\n",
        "# Peer market-cap similarity range\n",
        "MIN_MARKET_CAP_RATIO = 0.10\n",
        "MAX_MARKET_CAP_RATIO = 10\n",
        "\n",
        "TARGET_INPUT = input(\n",
        "    \"Enter target company name or NSE ticker \"\n",
        "    \"(e.g., TCS, Infosys, Reliance): \"\n",
        ").strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nTarget entered:\", TARGET_INPUT)"
      ],
      "id": "bXuk4wmOaLqf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "umN6pqKkaLqg"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 4. Resolve the target to an NSE / Yahoo Finance ticker"
      ],
      "id": "umN6pqKkaLqg"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 132,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "oZ1fJ1gJaLqg",
        "outputId": "e94722bd-28a3-48c6-a93e-ce1b1a1d4759"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "✓ Target ticker identified: OBEROIRLTY.NS\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "def resolve_nse_ticker(company_input):\n",
        "    company_input = company_input.upper().strip()\n",
        "\n",
        "    if company_input.endswith(\".NS\"):\n",
        "        return company_input\n",
        "\n",
        "    possible_ticker = company_input + \".NS\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        info = yf.Ticker(possible_ticker).info\n",
        "\n",
        "        if (\n",
        "            info.get(\"regularMarketPrice\") is not None\n",
        "            or info.get(\"currentPrice\") is not None\n",
        "            or info.get(\"marketCap\") is not None\n",
        "        ):\n",
        "            return possible_ticker\n",
        "    except Exception:\n",
        "        pass\n",
        "\n",
        "    return None\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "target_ticker = resolve_nse_ticker(TARGET_INPUT)\n",
        "\n",
        "if target_ticker is None:\n",
        "    raise ValueError(\n",
        "        \"Could not identify the company. \"\n",
        "        \"Please enter a valid NSE ticker such as TCS, INFY, \"\n",
        "        \"HDFCBANK or RELIANCE.\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"✓ Target ticker identified:\", target_ticker)"
      ],
      "id": "oZ1fJ1gJaLqg"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "pZ5xtwH_aLqh"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 5. Fetch target-company information"
      ],
      "id": "pZ5xtwH_aLqh"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 133,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "HOmdmOnCaLqh",
        "outputId": "7c6ae314-90d2-4867-cc87-38c7bbeab08f"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "======================================================================\n",
            "TARGET COMPANY\n",
            "======================================================================\n",
            "Company                  : Oberoi Realty Limited\n",
            "Ticker                   : OBEROIRLTY.NS\n",
            "Sector                   : Real Estate\n",
            "Industry                 : Real Estate - Development\n",
            "Market Cap               : 662,410,559,488.00\n",
            "Current Price            : 1,821.80\n",
            "52W High                 : 1,986.10\n",
            "52W Low                  : 1,391.20\n",
            "Shares Outstanding       : 363,602,237.00\n",
            "Country                  : India\n",
            "Website                  : https://www.oberoirealty.com\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "def get_company_info(ticker_symbol):\n",
        "    ticker_obj = yf.Ticker(ticker_symbol)\n",
        "    info = ticker_obj.info\n",
        "\n",
        "    # Primary retrieval\n",
        "    market_cap = info.get(\"marketCap\")\n",
        "    current_price = info.get(\"currentPrice\") or info.get(\"regularMarketPrice\")\n",
        "    shares_outstanding = info.get(\"sharesOutstanding\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    # Fallback 1: fast_info property\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        if market_cap is None or pd.isna(market_cap):\n",
        "            market_cap = ticker_obj.fast_info.get('marketCap')\n",
        "        if shares_outstanding is None or pd.isna(shares_outstanding):\n",
        "            shares_outstanding = ticker_obj.fast_info.get('sharesOutstanding')\n",
        "    except:\n",
        "        pass\n",
        "\n",
        "    # Fallback 2: Cross-calculation if one is missing\n",
        "    if current_price and current_price > 0:\n",
        "        if (market_cap is None or pd.isna(market_cap)) and shares_outstanding:\n",
        "            market_cap = shares_outstanding * current_price\n",
        "        elif (shares_outstanding is None or pd.isna(shares_outstanding)) and market_cap:\n",
        "            shares_outstanding = market_cap / current_price\n",
        "\n",
        "    # Fallback 3: Ticker-specific overrides (Reliance)\n",
        "    if ticker_symbol == \"RELIANCE.NS\":\n",
        "        if pd.isna(market_cap) or market_cap == 0:\n",
        "            # Use Enterprise Value as a proxy if Market Cap is totally missing\n",
        "            market_cap = info.get(\"enterpriseValue\", 20740088791040)\n",
        "        if pd.isna(shares_outstanding) or shares_outstanding == 0:\n",
        "            # Reliance has approx 6.77B shares\n",
        "            shares_outstanding = 6766000000\n",
        "\n",
        "    return {\n",
        "        \"Company\": info.get(\"longName\"),\n",
        "        \"Ticker\": ticker_symbol,\n",
        "        \"Sector\": info.get(\"sector\"),\n",
        "        \"Industry\": info.get(\"industry\"),\n",
        "        \"Market Cap\": market_cap,\n",
        "        \"Current Price\": current_price,\n",
        "        \"52W High\": info.get(\"fiftyTwoWeekHigh\"),\n",
        "        \"52W Low\": info.get(\"fiftyTwoWeekLow\"),\n",
        "        \"Shares Outstanding\": shares_outstanding,\n",
        "        \"Country\": info.get(\"country\"),\n",
        "        \"Website\": info.get(\"website\")\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "target_info = get_company_info(target_ticker)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
        "print(\"TARGET COMPANY\")\n",
        "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
        "\n",
        "for key, value in target_info.items():\n",
        "    if isinstance(value, (int, float)) and not pd.isna(value):\n",
        "        print(f\"{key:<25}: {value:,.2f}\")\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        print(f\"{key:<25}: {value}\")"
      ],
      "id": "HOmdmOnCaLqh"
    },
